qualification = "Scoped compile and one combined journey passed seven real routes: Rust embedded, Python embedded and mTLS, TypeScript embedded and local socket, Go local socket, and Swift C ABI. Common scope, version, source digest, exact nanoseconds, binary originals, idempotence and context digest survived daemon restart and embedded reopen. Apple and mobile runtime matrices remain unqualified."

